  body:()=> '<p class="desc">One model call, two inputs: <code>system</code> = the <b>system prompt</b> (the instructions; click the <code>build_system_prompt</code> node to read all '+SYSTEM_PROMPT.length.toLocaleString()+' chars) and <code>user</code> = <code>json.dumps(pack)</code>, the <b>'+Object.keys(P).length+' pack sections below</b> (the data). '
    +'Reason privately, write the prose <code>message</code>, then call <code>record_coach_tail</code> once for the structured tail. '
